\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 Daemons are non-interactive cognitive agents that run continuously or on schedules/triggers within bounded scopes and budgets. 0.6.1 Representative Daemon Families EchoDaemon Detects repeated user/system patterns and manual workflows.\
