\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 0.7 AI + Driver Stack Overview (Model Layer, Driver Fabric, Capsules, Governance)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 0.7.1 Stack Composition Model Layer Text, code, vision, and other models.\
\uc0\u9675  Provided via a pluggable Model Provider abstraction.\
1. Driver Fabric OS drivers (filesystem, processes, windows, networking, containers).\
\uc0\u9675  Unix / Kernel Execution Layer (governed shell/command execution with full audit).\
\uc0\u9675  Package & Environment drivers (brew, choco/winget, apt/dnf/yum/pacman, pip/conda/poetry, etc.).\
\uc0\u9675  Software & SaaS drivers (Office, Google, IDEs, ticketing, Git, CI/CD, finance).\
\uc0\u9675  Data and Research & Simulation drivers (DBs, warehouses, MATLAB, R, CAD/CAE, HPC schedulers).\
\uc0\u9675  Governance & Policy drivers (policy evaluation services, compliance hooks).\
2. Capsule & Workflow Layer Capsules encode reusable workflows:\
Driver graphs, environment specs, tests, metadata.\
\uc0\u9675  Workflow Engine composes Capsules and drivers into higher-level flows.\
\uc0\u9675  Workflow\u8594 App Synthesizer converts recorded operations into Capsules.\
3. Governance & Policy Plane Policy Engine, Safety Harness Builder, Compliance Packs.\
\uc0\u9675  Budget & cost guardrails, AI Billing & Usage Fabric.\
\uc0\u9675  Regulator Fabric, Law-of-the-OS & AI Court integration (later layers).\
4. Ledger & Observability Layer Project Ledger, Record Auditor, telemetry and traces.\
\uc0\u9675  Evidence Packs and replay/Temporal Backtesting surfaces.\
5. Workspaces & Twins Domain Engines built on the shared substrate.\
\uc0\u9675  Digital / Cognitive / Enterprise / Reality Twins for simulation and planning.\
6. Presentation Layer Desktop and web dashboards, CLI, chat/voice interfaces, APIs. 7. 0.7.2 Core Interaction Pattern Intent capture User or persona expresses a goal via a Workspace (e.g., \'93deploy this service\'94, \'93run this simulation\'94, \'93prepare audit pack\'94). 1. Planning & reasoning Personas (Sora, Aria, AIC variants) and daemons generate a plan:\
Which Capsules and drivers to use, \'a7 Which environments or twins to target, \'a7 What preconditions and approvals are needed. 2. Governance evaluation Policy Engine evaluates plan:\
Identity, roles, data classification, budgets, risk thresholds.\
\uc0\u9675  May require human approvals or regulator-defined checks.\
3. Execution Orchestrator runs Capsules and drivers according to the approved plan.\
\uc0\u9675  System Execution and Package drivers are invoked as governed, logged operations.\
\'a0\
\'a0\
4. y g g , gg p Observation & learning Outcomes recorded in Ledger, CIR, metrics.\
\uc0\u9675  Daemons mine traces to update:\
Capsule templates, environment specs, plans, and policies. 5. Packaging & sharing High-value workflows are generalized into Capsule Packs, My Stack Capsules, and Marketplace entries. 6. Critically, models never directly call OS or external resources; they only propose plans that are realized via drivers and Capsules under policy control.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

