H i ( di l id li d )\
\'a0\
\'a0\
5. Human actions (edits, merges, approvals, overrides, policy updates). \'a7 Agent/Capsule actions (runs, driver invocations, twin manipulations). \'a7 System events (health changes, drifts, auto-remediations). \'a7 Policy decisions (allow/deny/require-approval/transform). \'a7 Supports:\
