Datasets, models, experiments, simulation outputs, fitted parameters.\
\uc0\u9675  Links:\
To CIR (papers, notes, reports). \'a7 To ledger events (runs, experiments, validations). \'a7 To policies (governance of experiments and twin use). 6. Interfaces & Contracts Exposed as internal services (or library interfaces) to:\
Application/Orchestrator.\
\uc0\u9675  Workspaces (Dev, Research, etc.).\
\uc0\u9675  Cognitive Layer (AIC, personas, daemons).\
\uc0\u9675  Governance & Billing services (read-only or write via events).\
\'95 Limited, read-only subsets exposed via:\
Regulator Fabric.\
\uc0\u9675  Federated cross-OS/HyperMesh protocols (later).\
\'95 Security / Compliance Notes\
All stores carry:\
Tenant ID, project ID, classification, residency and retention labels.\
\'95 Storage layer enforces:\
Encryption at rest and in transit.\
\uc0\u9675  Tenant isolation boundaries.\
\uc0\u9675  Retention and archival rules configured per data class.\
\'95 2.1.4 Indices (Search, Vector, Graph) & Observability Stores\
To make the Data Plane efficient and useful for reasoning, planning, and observability, primary stores are complemented by index and telemetry services. Index Families Search Indices Full-text indices over:\
CIR content. \'a7 Project metadata. \'a7 Capsule manifests and policy docs. \'a7 Selected ledger event payloads and logbook entries.\
\uc0\u9675  Provide:\
