Services, drivers, Capsules, daemons, models. \'a7 Environment drift counters, health indicators, cost metrics.\
\uc0\u9675  Time-series DB or equivalent backend.\
1. Structured Logs Logs from:\
Services, drivers, daemons, security components. \'a7 System Execution Layer commands (stdout/stderr metadata, exit codes). \'a7 Policy Engine and Governance decisions.\
\uc0\u9675  Data Plane decides which logs are:\
Promoted to CIR or ledger as first-class content, \'a7 Retained purely as observability. 2. Traces Distributed traces across:\
