\cf2 2.2.4 Workflows, Capsules & Driver Invocations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 All concrete work flows through Workflows, Capsules, and drivers. Plans & Workflows Plan:\
A directed graph or sequence of steps, each step being:\
A Capsule run, \'a7 A driver call, \'a7 A human approval/gate, \'a7 A decision/branch node.\
\'95 Workflow:\
A named, reusable, versioned Plan template:\
With parameters, branching logic, retries, compensations.\
\'95 Capsule Execution\
Capsule is the atomic executable unit:\
\'a0\
\'a0\
\'95 Capsule is the atomic executable unit:\
Manifest describes:\
