\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 6.3 Project Ledger Store & Time-Ordered Event / Hash Chain\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 6.3.1 Purpose & Responsibilities The Project Ledger is the tamper-evident event backbone:\
Record all meaningful actions:\
User actions, agent actions, driver calls, Capsule runs, policy decisions, env changes, incidents.\
\'95 Support:\
Record Auditor & Logbook, Evidence Packs, forensic reconstruction, Temporal Backtesting, compliance audits.\
\'95 6.3.2 Key Components\
Ledger Event Store ledger_event records:\
event_id, tenant_id, project_id, timestamps. \'a7 actor (user or service principal + persona/daemon). \'a7 event_type (taxonomy: DOC_EDIT, TASK_UPDATE, CAPSULE_RUN_*, SYSTEM_EXEC_COMMAND, PACKAGE_CHANGE, POLICY_EVAL, MODEL_CALL, SECURITY_ALERT, etc.). \'a7 payload (structured JSON). \'a7 prev_event_hash and event_hash.\
\'95 Hash Chain Integrity\
Per-project or per-scope hash chains.\
\uc0\u9675  Optional periodic \'93anchor events\'94 (daily/weekly summary hashes) for external verification.\
\'95 Projections & Views\
Materialized timelines for:\
Task histories, incidents, releases, Capsule runs, env changes.\
\'95 6.3.3 Data Flows\
Any significant operation:\
Assembles a strongly-typed event via internal API.\
\uc0\u9675  Writes to Ledger (transactional).\
\'95 Observability, Evidence Packs, and TRF:\
Join ledger events with logs, traces, CIR snapshots, MachineProfiles, Capsule manifests.\
\'95 6.3.4 Failure Modes & Recovery\
Ledger write failure:\
For critical events (security, policy, env changes): operation fails/rolls back.\
\uc0\u9675  For non-critical telemetry: operation may proceed but event buffered for retry.\
\'95 Hash chain inconsistency:\
Detected by Ledger Integrity Daemon; flagged and quarantined; offline tools recompute and analyze.\
\'95 6.3.5 Security & Compliance Notes\
Ledger is logically immutable.\
\'95 Access is highly controlled (role, regulator, auditor scopes).\
\'95 Exports for regulators:\
Support signed bundles with hash-chain proofs.\
