\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 8.4 Capsule Lifecycle (Design \uc0\u8594  Draft \u8594  Review \u8594  Publish \u8594  Run \u8594  Deprecate)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 8.4.1 Stages Design Capsule authored via text editor or Operator Studio (8.19) or synthesized from recordings (8.11).\
\uc0\u9675  Structure may be incomplete; no guarantees.\
1. Draft Manifest structurally valid; dependencies resolved.\
\uc0\u9675  Runnable only in:\
Developer/test sandboxes, or \'a7 Designated \'93labs\'94 tenants/workspaces.\
\uc0\u9675  Metrics gathered to inform review.\
2. Review Static checks:\
Safety, security, complexity, env coverage.\
\uc0\u9675  Human review:\
Domain expert, SRE, Security, Finance, etc. as required by policy.\
\uc0\u9675  Test runs:\
Test Capsules executed in representative environments. 3. Publish All required checks/tests passed, approvals granted.\
\uc0\u9675  Capsule marked ACTIVE within visibility scope (project/team/tenant/marketplace).\
\uc0\u9675  Version pinned and immutable.\
4. Run Executions recorded as Run instances:\
Bound to manifest version, Blueprint version, policy version.\
\uc0\u9675  Each run emits:\
Ledger events, logs, metrics, traces. \'a7 Optional Evidence Packs (8.17). 5. Deprecate & Retire Deprecate:\
Capsule hidden from default discovery, flagged in search. \'a7 New use discouraged; existing flows may keep using pinned version until migrated.\
\uc0\u9675  Retire:\
New runs prohibited. \'a7 Historical data kept for audit and replay. 6. 8.4.2 Governance Integration Lifecycle transitions drive Ledger events (capsule.created, capsule.review_started, capsule.published, capsule.deprecated, etc.).\
\'a0\
\'a0\
\'95 Policies may:\
