\uc0\u9675  Limit publishing rights to specific roles.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 8.5 Capsule Execution Engine & Sandboxing (Driver Scopes, Budgets, Policies)\
