\uc0\u9675  Assigns step placement (local node, sandbox, cluster, remote host).\
\uc0\u9675  Deals with parallelization and ordering.\
\'95 Sandbox Manager\
Creates per-run containers/VMs/sandboxes as needed (8.15).\
\uc0\u9675  Applies:\
Resource limits (CPU, RAM, disk). \'a7 Network policies (egress controls, whitelisted endpoints). \'a7 Filesystem scoping (project workspaces, readonly mounts).\
\'95 Policy & Safety Layer\
Evaluates Capsule + parameters + caller context against:\
Policy packs (Section 10). \'a7 Safety Harnesses (e.g., command allow/block lists, path guards).\
\uc0\u9675  Can:\
Require approvals. \'a7 Force sandbox level. \'a7 Reject or downgrade high-risk steps.\
\'95 Budget & Quota Enforcer\
Ties into Billing & Usage Fabric (Section 15).\
\uc0\u9675  Enforces:\
Model token budgets. \'a7 Driver call quotas. \'a7 System Execution quotas (command count, total runtime). \'a7 Cluster/compute quotas.\
\'95 Run Recorder\
Emits structured events to Ledger for:\
Run start/end. \'a7 Step attempts. \'a7 Policy decisions. \'a7 Errors and retried steps.\
\'95 8.5.3 Execution Semantics\
Idempotent vs non-idempotent steps explicitly declared.\
\'95 Failure handling:\
Retries with backoff where allowed.\
\uc0\u9675  Fallback or compensation flows (saga pattern) for multi-step operations.\
\'95 Human-in-the-loop:\
