\uc0\u9675  Enterprise Mode:\
SSO via OIDC/SAML. \'a7 SCIM-driven provisioning and group sync.\
\'95 Non-human identities\
\'a0\
\'a0\
\'95 Personas (Sora, Aria, AIC variants) as logical identities:\
Always bound to a \{User, Tenant, Project\} context and scoped credentials.\
\uc0\u9675  Daemons & background agents:\
Separate service principals with explicit driver scopes and budgets.\
\uc0\u9675  Plugins, connectors, and external services:\
Represented as service accounts with tightly scoped capabilities.\
\uc0\u9675  Tenant & org identities\
A tenant represents an isolated org or group:\
Owns policies, drivers, Capsules, workspaces, Compliance Packs, and private Marketplace catalog. \'a7 Has independent encryption keys, billing accounts, and federation settings.\
\'95 10.2.2 Authorization Model (RBAC + ABAC)\
RBAC baseline Representative roles:\
TENANT_ADMIN, ORG_ADMIN, PROJECT_OWNER, EDITOR, REVIEWER, VIEWER, SECURITY_ADMIN, SRE_ADMIN, AUDITOR, REGULATOR, SERVICE_ACCOUNT, AUTOMATION_AGENT.\
\uc0\u9675  Roles determine:\
Which projects can be viewed/modified. \'a7 Which Capsules can be authored, reviewed, executed. \'a7 Which drivers and policies can be configured.\
\'95 ABAC refinement\
Attributes on actors:\
Department, location, clearance, employment type, device posture, risk score.\
\uc0\u9675  Attributes on resources:\
Tenant, project, workspace, data classification, residency tags, env type (dev/stage/prod).\
\uc0\u9675  Context attributes:\
Time of day, network zone, MFA status, ongoing incidents.\
\uc0\u9675  Policies can express rules like:\
\'93PHI can be read only by Clinician roles from managed devices in region X with MFA enabled.\'94 \'a7 \'93Infra-changing Capsules may run only in staging after business hours unless break-glass.\'94\
\'95 10.2.3 Driver & Capsule Scoping\
Every driver invocation is checked against:\
Actor identity & role.\
\uc0\u9675  Tenant & project membership.\
\uc0\u9675  Capsule\'92s own policy (who may run it, in which env).\
\uc0\u9675  Tenant-wide and Compliance Pack restrictions.\
\'95 Capsules and plugins run under derived scopes:\
They inherit and may further constrain the caller\'92s identity.\
\uc0\u9675  They never gain more privilege than their manifest + policy allow.\
\'95 10.2.4 Failure Modes & Recovery\
Misconfigured roles or policies blocking critical work:\
Policy simulation & dry-run tooling.\
\uc0\u9675  Staged policy rollouts with \'93monitor\'94 mode before enforce.\
\uc0\u9675  Emergency break-glass roles:\
Time-limited, multi-party approvals. \'a7 Heavy logging and e.g. enforced Evidence Pack generation.\
\'95 IdP outages:\
Existing sessions continue until expiry (configurable).\
\uc0\u9675  Local emergency admin accounts (with strong safeguards) for recovery.\
