\cf2 10.3.3 Safety Harness Builder (Commands, Packages, Drivers, Workflows)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Purpose Provide a domain-specific surface to regulate dangerous capabilities, especially:\
System Execution (Unix / OS commands).\
\uc0\u9675  Package & Env changes.\
\uc0\u9675  Infra-touching drivers.\
\uc0\u9675  High-impact Capsules and workflows.\
\'95 Capabilities\
Risk tiers:\
SAFE \'96 allowed under constraints; logged.\
\uc0\u9675  WARN \'96 allowed but prompts user with context; confirmation required.\
\uc0\u9675  REQUIRE_APPROVAL \'96 human or multi-party approval.\
\uc0\u9675  BLOCKED \'96 not permitted except under temporary break-glass.\
\'95 Command-level constraints\
Allowed commands and patterns:\
Arguments, paths, hosts, env types.\
\uc0\u9675  Example:\
Allow rm only in sandbox directories; forbid combinations of rm -rf outside those paths. \'a7 Allow docker only non-privileged, non-host-mounted.\
\'95 Package-level constraints\
Approved repos (internal mirrors, vendor repos).\
\uc0\u9675  Blocklisted packages or versions (e.g., known vulnerable libs).\
\uc0\u9675  Max number of package changes per plan or per run.\
\'95 Workflow-level constraints\
Harness templates for Capsule classes:\
\'93Prod-safe Capsule\'94, \'93Security-reviewed Capsule\'94, \'93Student-safe Capsule\'94.\
\uc0\u9675  Enforce:\
Pre-checks (smoke tests, dry-run). \'a7 Post-checks (health checks, regression Test Capsules). \'a7 Evidence Pack generation for each run.\
\'95 Runtime Behavior\
Before executing:\
Policy Engine consults Safety Harness definitions.\
\uc0\u9675  Outcome:\
Execute with limits, or warn, or escalate to approval, or block.\
\uc0\u9675  All outcomes recorded in Ledger and visible in Cybersecurity / Operator workspaces.\
\'95 10.4 Compliance Packs\
Purpose Provide reusable, configurable bundles that encode regulatory frameworks into OS Dashboard via:\
Policies,\
\'95 Safety Harness defaults,\
\'95 Evidence Pack schemas,\
\'95 Dashboards and reporting views.\
\'95 Components\
Policy templates Storage & residency rules.\
\uc0\u9675  Access control requirements (MFA, least privilege, separation of duties).\
\uc0\u9675  Logging and retention expectations.\
\uc0\u9675  Data minimization and export constraints.\
\'95 Runtime controls\
Automatic masking/tokenization/anonymization of PII/PHI/PCI data.\
\uc0\u9675  Restrictions on sending sensitive data to external LLMs or providers.\
\uc0\u9675  Env separation (dev vs staging vs prod vs regulated enclaves)\
\'a0\
\'a0\
\'95 Env separation (dev vs staging vs prod vs regulated enclaves).\
\uc0\u9675  Evidence & reporting templates\
Predefined Record Auditor & Regulator Fabric views:\
