\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 Deployment Modes Local Mode (Single Workstation, Offline-First) Everything runs on a single host (laptop/desktop).\
\uc0\u9675  Storage is local (embedded DB + filesystem).\
\uc0\u9675  Drivers are primarily local:\
OS / filesystem / processes. \'a7 Local Unix/System Execution. \'a7 Local Package Managers (brew / choco / winget / apt / dnf / \'85). \'a7 Optional user-scoped SaaS accounts.\
\uc0\u9675  Governance is user-sovereign:\
