\uc0\u9675  Multi-tenant: many orgs share cluster resources with strong isolation.\
\uc0\u9675  Drivers include:\
Shared SaaS integrations (M365, Google Workspace, Git hosts). \'a7 Org-level System Execution endpoints (bastion hosts, worker pools). \'a7 Org-controlled Package & Env drivers (IT-governed). \'a7 Data, Research, Governance drivers.\
\uc0\u9675  Governance is hard-enforced via the Policy & Governance Engine.\
\uc0\u9675  Regulator Fabric and Law-of-the-OS run as first-class services.\
2. Hybrid Mode (On-Prem + Cloud) Control plane and bulk storage in cloud or central cluster.\
\uc0\u9675  Sensitive data & System Execution nodes on-prem or in VPCs.\
\uc0\u9675  Drivers split:\
Cloud drivers (SaaS, analytics, some data). \'a7 On-prem drivers (DBs, microservices, Unix hosts, HPC clusters).\
\uc0\u9675  Governance orchestrates decisions across both; central policies, distributed enforcement.\
3. Edge Mode (Remote / Lab / Field Devices) Lightweight agents on edge devices (lab rigs, factory machines, field laptops, embedded devices).\
\uc0\u9675  Central cluster hosts:\
Cognitive planning, policy, ledger, marketplace.\
\uc0\u9675  Edge nodes expose:\
Local OS and simulator drivers. \'a7 Lab instrumentation or OT/industrial interfaces.\
\uc0\u9675  Emphasis on:\
I t itt t ti it\
