Single graph \uc0\u8594  clearer global reasoning, easier cross-domain queries.\
\uc0\u9675  Multiple graphs \u8594  simpler performance tuning and isolation per domain but more integration overhead.\
\'95 Status:\
Open; early implementation may favor a single store with namespaced graph types, evolving to more specialized storage if needed. (b) Ledger & Evidence Model \'96 DB vs Log Service + Hash Chain Decision: Canonical representation of the Ledger and Evidence Packs. Option A \'96 DB-based Ledger Append-only tables in a relational store with transactional semantics.\
\'95 Option B \'96 Log-based Ledger\
Log service (Kafka-like) as canonical; query via projections into databases.\
\'a0\
\'a0\
