\uc0\u9675  Driver Layer Complexity & Fragility\
Risk: combinatorial explosion of drivers and environments.\
\uc0\u9675  Mitigation:\
Strict driver manifest schema; test suites per driver; canary deployments. \'a7 Start with a small, well-documented support matrix.\
\'95 State Explosion (CIR, Ledger, Capsules, Blueprints, Twins)\
Risk: runaway complexity in stored state.\
\uc0\u9675  Mitigation:\
Careful indexing schemes; archival tiers; retention policies. \'a7 Periodic refactors driven by AIC + Meta-Design Studio.\
\'95 Model Drift & Single-Provider Dependency\
Risk: degraded reasoning quality or vendor dependence.\
