Pluggable Model Layer, compatibility tests for model swaps. \'a7 Observability around reasoning quality; progressive provider diversification.\
\'95 Capsule Runtime Safety & Resource Exhaustion\
Risk: Capsules causing unintended side-effects or resource abuse.\
\uc0\u9675  Mitigation:\
Safety Harnesses, sandboxing, quotas. \'a7 Policy-gated escalation for privileged actions.\
\'95 Performance & Cost\
