\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 Purpose of Section 17 This section defines the Meta-Stack: the layered capability hierarchy that sits on top of the core OS Dashboard platform (Sections 0\'9616) and turns it from:\
A powerful per-user / per-org OS (Capsules + Drivers + Workspaces + Policies), into\
\'95 A research & simulation OS,\
\'95 A meta-system that reasons about itself and multiple organizations,\
\'95 A federated ecosystem fabric (inter-OS, cross-org),\
\'95 A cognitive, self-evolving, twin-of-reality infrastructure, and finally\
\'95 A norm- and obligation-aware constitutional stack that governs all of the above.\
\'95 These are architectural capability layers, not separate codebases. They are:\
Strictly dependency-ordered (higher \uc0\u8594  depends on lower).\
