\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 19.6.1 Canonical Terminology Summary A curated glossary mapping terms of art \uc0\u8594  concise definitions \u8594  primary sections. Examples (not exhaustive):\
Capsule Executable graph representing a workflow or behavior. See Sections 3.8, 8.x, 19.1.\
\'95 Environment Blueprint\
Declarative spec for runtime tools, packages, and constraints. See Sections 3.9, 8.12, 19.2.\
\'95 Driver\
Adapter between OS Dashboard and external systems or runtimes. See Section 5.x, 19.2.\
\'95 CIR (Canonical Information Record)\
Structured knowledge artifact with provenance and classification. See Sections 2.x, 7.x.\
\'95 Evidence Pack\
Structured bundle providing audit-grade evidence for a scoped event or period. See Sections 8.17, 11.7, 19.4.\
\'95 Law-of-the-OS\
Constitutional policy layer constraining all actions. See Sections 10.x, 17.6.5, 19.3.3.\
\'95 Twin (Digital / Enterprise / Cognitive)\
Representations of systems, organizations, or persons at various abstraction levels. See Sections 3.13, 17.3.x.\
\'95 The published spec includes a full table mapping each term to key sections.\
19.6.2 Symbolic / TRF Notation Reference For the Theoretical Reasoning Framework (TRF) and Meta-Stack reasoning:\
Core objects ( \\mathcal\{C\} ) \'96 set of concepts.\
\uc0\u9675  ( \\mathcal\{A\} ) \'96 set of assertions.\
\uc0\u9675  ( \\mathcal\{E\} ) \'96 set of evidence items.\
\uc0\u9675  ( G = (V, E) ) \'96 reasoning graph.\
\uc0\u9675  ( H_t, M_t, E_t ) \'96 hypothesis, model, and evidence at time t.\
\'95 Relations\
( H \\vdash A ) \'96 hypothesis H entails assertion A.\
\uc0\u9675  Confidence scores: ( c(A) \\in [0,1] ).\
\uc0\u9675  Epistemic statuses: \{true, false, uncertain, disputed\}.\
\'95 Mappings\
TRF nodes map to CIR documents, model runs, or Capsule executions via IDs.\
\uc0\u9675  Canon of Truth (future) uses TRF constructs to track claim provenance, contradictions, and resolutions.\
\'95 These conventions are referenced in Section 17 (Meta-Stack) and in TRF-oriented Capsules (19.1.3, 19.3.2).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

