\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 19.11 Example User Journeys & UX Flows\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 19.11.1 Developer Journey \'96 From Repo Checkout to Production Release\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 High-level phases:\
Developer adopts a project in Master Stack. 1. Repo Bootstrap Capsule converges environment. 2. Feature work tracked in Tasks; Commit\uc0\u8594 Task and Merge Advisor guide merges. 3. Pre-Merge Capsule validates changes. 4. Release Capsule orchestrates build, tests, deployment. 5. Release Evidence Pack is generated and stored.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 19.11.2 Researcher Journey \'96 From Hypothesis to Published Paper & IP Capsule\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Phases:\
Hypothesis captured as TRF + CIR entries. 1. Parameter Sweep Capsule executes experiments. 2. Research Workspace aggregates and visualizes results. 3. Model Validation & Benchmark Capsules run. 4. Writer workspace and Book/Paper Build Capsules produce manuscripts. 5. IP Capsule encapsulates code, env specs, and evidence for reuse/protection.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 19.11.3 Security Engineer Journey \'96 From Alert to Auto-Remediated Incident\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Phases:\
Cybersecurity Workspace receives an alert from sensors/logs. 1. Triage Capsule runs targeted diagnostics (read-only). 2. Hardening/Auto-Remediation Capsule proposes actions under Safety Harness. 3. Engineer approves; Capsule executes governed changes. 4. Incident Evidence Pack is assembled. 5. Lessons learned feed back into policies and harnesses.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 19.11.4 Finance / Ops Journey \'96 From Workflows to Cashflow & Strategy Simulation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Phases:\
Recurring finance workflows (invoicing, payables, payroll) expressed as Capsules. 1. Business Console aggregates KPIs and cashflow views. 2. Strategy Simulation Capsules evaluate alternative scenarios. 3. Results feed into Master Stack and Meta-Stack Strategy Garden for higher-level planning.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 19.11.5 Regulator / Auditor Journey \'96 From Request to Evidence Pack & Replay\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Phases:\
Regulator request arrives through Regulator Fabric. 1. Scoped search for relevant Ledger segments and Evidence Packs. 2. Evidence Pack Capsule assembles a regulator-grade bundle. 3. Optional replay of workflows in read-only mode for verification. 4. Regulator reviews and may issue follow-ups; all interactions are logged.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 19.12 Migration & Integration Patterns\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 19.12.1 From Pure SaaS Tooling to Driver-Aware OS\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Pattern:\
Start with read-only SaaS drivers (e.g., GitHub, Jira, Google Docs). 1. Ingest CIR from existing systems; establish Archive/Continuity. 2. Introduce Capsules that orchestrate existing SaaS workflows. 3. Gradually enable governed write operations under policy and harnesses. 4. Consolidate observability and Evidence Packs inside OS Dashboard.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 19.12.2 From Siloed Research Stacks to Unified Research Workspace\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Pattern:\
Wrap existing scripts and notebooks as Research Capsules 1\
\'a0\
\'a0\
Wrap existing scripts and notebooks as Research Capsules. 1. Introduce Environment Blueprints for reproducible experiments. 2. Centralize logging and experiment metadata in Research Knowledge Graph. 3. Add parameter sweeps, validation harnesses, and HPC integration. 4. Later, integrate Digital Twins and Meta-Stack research tools.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 19.12.3 Gradual Security Integration (Read-Only \uc0\u8594  Advisory \u8594  Governed Actions)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Phases:\
Read-only: Security workspace with log ingestion, posture assessment, and alerts. 1. Advisory: Security Capsules propose remediations; no direct infra changes. 2. Governed Actions: Auto-remediation Capsules run under strict policies, approvals, and harnesses.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 19.12.4 Legacy & Mainframe UIs \'96 Terminal/GUI Bridge Migration Paths\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Pattern:\
Capture known-good terminal/GUI flows via Legacy App & Terminal Bridge. 1. Turn them into parameterized Capsules with explicit inputs/outputs. 2. Gradually replace brittle UI steps with API- or driver-native operations when feasible. 3. Maintain full audit trail and Evidence Packs throughout the transition.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

